# Module: Student Management

## Scope

Student CRUD, admission numbers, enrollment, guardians, documents (MVP: CRUD only, no bulk import).

## Key Entities

`Student`, `StudentEnrollment`, `Guardian`, `StudentGuardian`, `StudentDocument`

## Permissions

```
students.profile.create
students.profile.read
students.profile.update
students.profile.delete
students.enrollment.manage
students.guardians.manage
students.documents.manage
```

## Commands (MVP)

- `CreateStudentCommand`, `UpdateStudentCommand`, `DeleteStudentCommand`
- `EnrollStudentCommand`, `TransferStudentCommand`, `WithdrawStudentCommand`
- `CreateGuardianCommand`, `LinkGuardianToStudentCommand`, `UnlinkGuardianFromStudentCommand`
- `UploadStudentDocumentCommand`, `DeleteStudentDocumentCommand`

## Queries

- `ListStudentsQuery` — paginated, filter by grade/class/section, scope-filtered
- `GetStudentByIdQuery` — includes enrollment + guardians summary
- `GetEnrollmentHistoryQuery`

## Business Rules

- `AdmissionNumber` unique per tenant — auto-generated: `{YEAR}-{SEQ}`
- Enrollment validates class capacity via `EnrollmentClassCapacityValidator`
- Soft delete student → deactivate active enrollments
- Guardian link triggers `GuardianLinkedIntegrationEvent` → parent portal invite

## Events

- `StudentAdmittedIntegrationEvent`
- `StudentPromotedIntegrationEvent`
- `StudentWithdrawnIntegrationEvent`
- `GuardianLinkedIntegrationEvent`

## Scope

- Teachers: read/update students in assigned class only
- Parents: read linked children only (`ScopeType.Self`)

## PII Handling

- Date of birth, address, phone — audit all access in sensitive export endpoints (Phase 2)
